-- FLL-GAR-2023 · coverage wave block 5a (2026-09-30): the block-1 tables wired into the worksheets — selections whose options are
-- generated FROM regulation_table_rows at apply time (one source by construction), lookup fills for the printed limits, and the input
-- fields those limits compare against. 25 fields on FLL-GAR-12/-14/-15/-16/-17. Requires block 1 (tables) — the inserts stay empty if a table is missing.
-- Quotes read on the rendered PDF in-session (VA); printed page in source_anchor. All is_required = false. STAGED — not applied.
-- Apply: node scripts/apply-migration.mjs scripts/migrations/20260930100000_fll_gar_2023_widgets_coverage_block5a.sql
-- Rollback: scripts/migrations/rollback-20260930100000_fll_gar_2023_widgets_coverage_block5a.sql
